        "fetched_at": "2026-11-04T23:45:00.718326+00:00",
        "payload": {
          "description": "About the Company\nAngelAi is the fintech innovation arm of Sun West Mortgage Company, a trusted leader in mortgage lending since 1980. We’re building emotionally intelligent AI systems that transform how people experience financial services, making homeownership faster, fairer, and more human. Our patented technologies power AngelAi and TRU Approvals® and real-time decision-making, helping borrowers compete with cash offers and navigate complex financial decisions with confidence. We are now developing a groundbreaking mobile experience that puts emotional intelligence at the center of the user's journey.\nAbout the Role\nYou’ll help build a predictive, emotionally responsive mobile interface for highly complex use cases like mortgage lending and financial services. Unlike traditional systems that rely solely on empirical data, our AI will\nDetect and interpret the user’s emotional state.\nDynamically adjust workflows based on emotional cues.\nDeliver a personalized, intuitive experience that feels human.\nPay range and compensation package\nEntry Level: $100,000–$120,000/year,\nExperienced / Exceptional Talent: $150,000–$200,000/year.\nAbout the Platform\nFirst-of-its-kind system where empathy meets automation.\nPioneering auto-morphing AI cell-modular agents that learn simple tasks and collaborate to solve complex problems.\nOver a dozen patents secured in AI and automation.\nTech Stack Overview\nFront end: React\nBackend:Node.js\nAWS Lambda\nAI Development: Python (auto-morphing AI cells)\nCore Systems: C/C++ (financial kernel), Java (via JNI)Databases: Oracle (financial engine), MongoDB (AI database)\nWe’ve secured over a dozen patents and are pioneering auto-morphing AI cell-modular agents that learn simple tasks and collaborate to solve complex problems .\nRole Details\nPosition Type: Fully Remote\nSalary Range:Entry Level: $100,000–$120,000/yearExperienced / Exceptional Talent: $150,000–$200,000/yearFreedom & Ownership: Choose your own problem. Solve it. Deliver a commercial product with a unique user experience .\nWhat We’re Looking For\nStrong proficiency in one or more of our core languages (Python, C++, Java, Node.js).\nExperience building scalable systems or AI-driven applications.\nCuriosity, creativity, and a desire to challenge legacy thinking.\nComfort with ambiguity and a passion for solving real-word problems.\nWilling to learn, disciplined and passionate .\nEqual Opportunity Statement\nWe are committed to diversity and inclusivity .\nContact us : swmc.resumes@swmc.com",
          "source_url": ""
        }
